<h1>Contact</h1>
<p class="lede">Whichever you prefer: a direct email or the form below.</p>

<p>Write to us at <a href="mailto:contacto@tuaccesible.com">contacto@tuaccesible.com</a>.</p>

<form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
  <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="9338efc0-195f-47b9-872f-4aca4a58b051">
  <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New inquiry from tuaccesible.com">
  <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="tuaccesible.com form">
  <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://tuaccesible.com/en/thank-you/">
  <p class="hp">
    <label for="botcheck">Leave this field empty</label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="botcheck" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  </p>

  <p>
    <label for="name">Name (required)</label><br>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="email">Email (required)</label><br>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="service">Service you're interested in</label><br>
    <select id="service" name="service">
      <option value="Other">Other</option>
      <option value="Express audit">Express audit</option>
      <option value="Site audit">Site audit</option>
      <option value="Corporate workshop">Corporate workshop</option>
      <option value="Full package">Full package</option>
    </select>
  </p>
  <p>
    <label for="message">Message (required)</label><br>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required></textarea>
  </p>

  <div class="form-legal">
    <p>Data protection, in short: tuaccesible uses your name, email and message only to reply to you, and keeps them for as long as the conversation lasts.</p>
    <p>The form is processed by Web3Forms, a provider with servers in the United States, and the message lands in our inbox. You can request access, correction or deletion by writing to <a href="mailto:contacto@tuaccesible.com">contacto@tuaccesible.com</a>. Full detail is in the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <button type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
